Behavioral note worth calling out in the changelog: `URLParam` now returns the still-encoded segment for encoded paths (`docs%2Freport.pdf`), which is the only lossless option — callers decode with `url.PathUnescape`. I could not run the suite in this turn, so the patch is verified by inspection against the resolution logic only.
